  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "40506fde-df69-c4fe-c32a-585e6c339c34",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "3da97ab7-d23a-241b-5aad-c813a59545f2",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "After qualifying as a doctor at AKU over two decades ago, Dr Haider has had a distinguished career in public health research and surgery in the United States.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "He has held key positions at eminent institutions such as Johns Hopkins University and the Boston-based Center for Surgery and Public Health, a joint initiative between Harvard University and the Brigham and Women's Hospital, during which he has overseen the research of over 150 faculty members and supervised grants worth over US $12 million.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "An accomplished trauma and acute care surgeon, Dr Haider has also been recognised for his work in the area of disparities in access to life-saving surgery.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "He is regarded as one of the foremost experts on healthcare inequities in the United States with projects focused on describing and mitigating unequal outcomes based on gender, race, sexual orientation, ethnicity, age and socioeconomic status.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
