      },
      {
        "_uid": "8880828f-6f4f-136f-91f4-f802eca767bd",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"Being chosen to lead the medical college where I became a doctor is truly a sacred trust and really a dream come true,\" said Dr Haider while speaking about his plans to use the power of a research-led University to enhance the prospects and wellbeing of disadvantaged people around the world.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Dr Haider believes that equality is the cornerstone of medicine and is keen to further the Medical College's mission of promoting the highest standards of medical education and research, while expanding access to safe, optimal and equitable healthcare. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "A frequent visitor to the campus, Dr Haider has acted as a mentor to many current and past students from AKU and has been a prominent part of the North America chapter of our global alumni network.  \n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "He is set to join the Medical College as Dean in January 2019.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Read the announcement \n   ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "here",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/news/Documents/Announcement_AH.pdf",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_self",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ".",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
